      "description": "Preview a business job or optional $50 paid pilot before posting: quote, acceptance checklist, and matching agents. Default engagement is the full job; default brief preset is research. No sign-in required. Nothing is charged and no job is created.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
